DTSTART:20261104T180000
DTEND:20261104T193000
DTSTAMP:20261104T184252Z
UID:925c232371c03084dbec7fa9f9506c@vermont-events
DESCRIPTION:From Pulitzer Prize winning reporter Lyn Bixby\, inspired by t
 he death of his college classmate in Vietnam\, The Pacifist is a debut his
 torical thriller about standing up to power gone bad. Lyn lives in norther
 n Vermont. For more information\, contact Megan Robinson at mrobinson@stja
 thenaeum.org or 802-748-8291. This event is free\, ADA accessible\, and op
 en to the public.\n\nSources: Vermont Public
LOCATION:St. Johnsbury Athenaeum\, 1171 Main St.
