DTEND:20261105T203000
DTSTAMP:20261104T184252Z
UID:46d5f2082b3204437a6b775d7483d4@vermont-events
DESCRIPTION:Celebrate the holiday season with a creative evening of wreath
  making. Each participant will create a fresh evergreen wreath using seaso
 nal greenery and decorative accents. Choose from a variety of ribbons\, pi
 necones\, berries\, and natural embellishments to design a wreath that ref
 lects your personal style and complements your holiday décor. Whether you
  prefer a traditional look or something more rustic and natural\, you’ll
  leave with a beautiful handmade wreath ready to welcome family and friend
 s throughout the season. No experience is necessary. This workshop is desi
 gned to be fun\, relaxing\, and enjoyable for all skill levels.\n\nSources
 : Vermont Public
LOCATION:Caron Designs Studio\, 859 Hitchcock Hill Road
URL:https://www.vermontpublic.org/vermont-events-calendar/event/evergreen-
 wreath-making-13-10-2026-08-15-22
END:VEVENT
